Use case: stylized-concept. One production game SPRITE ATLAS, with genuine transparent alpha background. Redraw the named character from the supplied Lizards Kingdom reference with far more detail: hand-painted dark fantasy, fine material texture, crisp ornate silhouettes, carefully shaded anatomy, restrained luminous rim lights. NOT pixel art, NOT flat vector shapes, NOT a 3D render. Preserve the exact species/design, colors and signature anatomy. Child-friendly adventure: no gore.
